{"id":"en_the-third-letter-is-my-goodbye","title":"The Third Letter Is My Goodbye","titleEn":"The Third Letter Is My Goodbye","description":"Diagnosed with terminal cancer and given only a month to live, Eleanor presents Ethan with divorce papers. She asks him to grant five final wishes so their poisonous marriage can end. Yet Ethan's emotional distance, combined with the manipulative schemes of Sophia, his first love, steadily wears her down. After Eleanor collapses, the truth about how her family was ruined comes to light, forcing Ethan to confront the reality that he has destroyed the one woman who genuinely loved him.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-third-letter-is-my-goodbye/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-third-letter-is-my-goodbye/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["All-Too-Late","Mystery","Tragic Love","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7daxf2/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_the-third-letter-is-my-goodbye_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7daxf2/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-third-letter-is-my-goodbye_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7daxf2/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-third-letter-is-my-goodbye_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7daxf2/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-third-letter-is-my-goodbye_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d